ia BANDEC,\n Sucursal 8321, Titular: SAC\nCaguayo S.A, Código REEUP: 234-0-60378, NIT: 30001311709, E-mail:\n <a href="mailto:director@caguayo.co.cu">director@cagauyo.co.cu</a>,<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>quien a los<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;\n</span>efectos del presente se denominará <b>“ENTIDAD COMERCIALIZADORA</b></span><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ansi-language:ES-MX" lang="ES-MX">"</span></b><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\nES-MX" lang="ES-MX">, </span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:ES-MX;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold" lang="ES-MX">quien actúa en nombre del creador :</span></p>\n\n\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:-24.8pt;margin-bottom:\n0in;margin-left:3.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\nES-MX" lang="ES-MX">Roberto Andrés  Mauri   Avila </span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:ES-MX" lang="ES-MX">con<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Identidad Permanente No. 73090118244 con\ndomicilio legal en Jesús menendez No. 23 Jiguaní Granma</span><span style="font-size:\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;" lang="ES-TRAD">, Provincia Granma</span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\nES-MX" lang="ES-MX"><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Registro Nacional del Creador\nArtístico con el No. 12388 y Código No. 170.</span></p>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right:-24.8pt;text-align:justify"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;" lang="ES-TRAD"