	('INNODB_COMPRESSION_FAILURE_THRESHOLD_PCT', NULL, '5', 'COMPILE-TIME', '5', 'GLOBAL', 'INT UNSIGNED', 'If the compression failure rate of a table is greater than this number more padding is added to the pages to reduce the failures. A value of zero implies no padding', '0', '100', '0', NULL, 'NO', 'OPTIONAL'),
