	('GTID_IGNORE_DUPLICATES', NULL, 'OFF', 'COMPILE-TIME', 'OFF', 'GLOBAL', 'BOOLEAN', 'When set, different master connections in multi-source replication are allowed to receive and process event groups with the same GTID (when using GTID mode). Only one will be applied, any others will be ignored. Within a given replication domain, just the sequence number will be used to decide whether a given GTID has been already applied; this means it is the responsibility of the user to ensure that GTID sequence numbers are strictly increasing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OFF,ON', 'NO', 'OPTIONAL'),
