	('OPTIMIZER_SEARCH_DEPTH', '62', '62', 'COMPILE-TIME', '62', 'SESSION', 'INT UNSIGNED', 'Maximum depth of search performed by the query optimizer. Values larger than the number of relations in a query result in better query plans, but take longer to compile a query. Values smaller than the number of tables in a relation result in faster optimization, but may produce very bad query plans. If set to 0, the system will automatically pick a reasonable value.', '0', '62', '1', NULL, 'NO', 'REQUIRED'),
